<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_965_2909.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich willig diennst zuvor,
<lb n="2"/>ersamen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, besonndern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>unnd gueten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>schryben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betreffenndt</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwern</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sebastian</unclear></persName>
<lb n="5"/>unnd <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sigmund</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollighofer</unclear></persName>, unnd
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßern</unclear> burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Cristoff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Krol</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="7"/>darinnen sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>, das wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">yemanden</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>uß unnserm mittel, zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhabend</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>raitung verordnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollten</unclear>, haben wir,
<lb n="10"/>alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verrerns</unclear> innhalts nach lenngs ver-
<lb n="11"/>nomen. Unnd geben E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>.
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daruff</unclear>, fründtlich und nachbarlich zu-
<lb n="13"/>erkennen, das wir unnserm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solch</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear> fürgehallten, der ist nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ur</unclear>-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bütig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhabende</unclear> raitung anzu-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hören</unclear>, so wöllen wir ime, E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/>gern nach, zu sollichem, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yemands</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>unnserm mittel, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuordnen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guter</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoffnung</unclear>, so die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">parthyen</unclear> also zusamen
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear>, sy werden sich allerdings <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünt</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/>lich mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einandern</unclear> vergleichen. Und
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mogen</unclear> E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. zu sollichem ainen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> ge-
<lb n="23"/>legnen tage fürnemen, und uns den-
<lb n="24"/>selben verkhünden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> das wir alls dan,
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear>, irem begern nach, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeordnen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wissen</unclear>, das wir E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. un-
<lb n="27"/>sern besonndern lieben und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_965_2910.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreyben</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> anntwort anzaigen
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, unnd sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">denselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> allen
<lb n="30"/>freunndtlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diennsten</unclear> ganz genaigt
<lb n="31"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetwillig</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1572-08-06" cert="medium" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">6t</unclear> Augusti
<lb n="32"/>anno 72</origDate>.
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> und
<lb n="34"/>rath der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_965_2911.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_965_2912.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/>Den ersamen unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyßen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermai=
<lb n="36"/>ster unnd Rathe der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sanck</unclear> Gallenn</orgName>,
<lb n="37"/>unnsern besonndern lieben unnd guotenn
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündenn</unclear>.
</p>
